# key-ring: from the menu, load the saved game setup/key-ring writes (by the castle's locked
# door at (15, 53), lock 28, with a key for lock 28 and a key for lock 3 in the pack); turn to
# face the door (two steps of Shift+A, 22.5 degrees each), then use the key for lock 3 on the
# door twice (left button on the key, right button on the door). With the flag the first use
# unlocks the door with the key for lock 28 ("Another key unlocks the lock.") and the second
# locks it again ("Another key locks the lock."); the original says "The key does not fit." to
# both
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
8000 down shift
8100 key a
8300 up shift
8800 down shift
8900 key a
9100 up shift
10000 move 265 92      # the key for lock 3, used on the door
10300 mdown 265 92 left
10600 mup 265 92 left
11800 move 122 100
12100 mdown 122 100 right
12400 mup 122 100 right
14000 move 265 92      # and again
14300 mdown 265 92 left
14600 mup 265 92 left
15800 move 122 100
16100 mdown 122 100 right
16400 mup 122 100 right
